        <key>heldAffineDeepTranslationX</key>
        <integer>-9</integer>
        <key>horizontalFit</key>
        <string>Barycentric displacement inside the three actual connection points. Outside that triangle use the nearest edge displacement, rather than extrapolating the affine x map into the native hook stem. Deep native controls retain one horizontal translation.</string>
